{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-humanities","title":"数字人文前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数字人文前沿-简介\">数字人文前沿 简介</h1><p>数字人文（Digital Humanities）是人文学科与计算技术深度交汇的学术领域。它不仅仅是将数字工具应用于传统人文研究，更是在重新定义人文学科的研究问题、方法论基础和知识生产方式。对博士研究者而言，数字人文既是一套可以即时使用的研究工具，也是一种需要批判性审视的方法论立场。</p>\n<p>本学科聚焦三个核心方向，覆盖从文本挖掘到数字档案建设再到计算叙事学的完整研究光谱。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>文本挖掘与分析</strong>介绍如何运用自然语言处理、主题建模、情感分析等计算工具处理大规模文本数据。重点不在于技术细节本身，而在于如何将计算发现转化为有意义的人文阐释，以及如何应对&quot;远距离阅读&quot;与&quot;近距离阅读&quot;之间的方法论张力。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>数字档案与文化遗产</strong>探讨数字化技术如何改变了档案的建设、访问和使用方式。从文献数字化的标准与实践到元数据设计，从数字保存的伦理到众包参与模式，数字档案正在重塑学术研究与公众参与文化遗产的方式。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>计算叙事学</strong>位于叙事学和计算机科学的交叉点，研究如何用计算方法分析叙事结构——从故事情节的自动检测到人物关系网络的建模，从情感弧线的量化到叙事视角的形式化。</p>\n<p>建议学习者先从文本挖掘建立技术直觉，再通过数字档案理解基础设施层面的挑战，最后在计算叙事学中看到计算方法与文学理论最深层的对话。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"text-mining","title":"文本挖掘与分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/text-mining","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"corpus-building-and-preprocessing","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 语料构建与预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/text-mining/corpus-building-and-preprocessing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"topic-modeling-and-classification","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 主题建模与文本分类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/text-mining/topic-modeling-and-classification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"word-embeddings-and-semantic-change","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 词嵌入与语义变迁","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/text-mining/word-embeddings-and-semantic-change"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-archives","title":"数字档案与文化遗产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/digital-archives","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digitization-standards-and-practice","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 数字化标准与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/digital-archives/digitization-standards-and-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metadata-and-knowledge-organization","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 元数据与知识组织","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/digital-archives/metadata-and-knowledge-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-preservation-and-public-engagement","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 数字保存与公众参与","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/digital-archives/digital-preservation-and-public-engagement"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"computational-narratology","title":"计算叙事学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/computational-narratology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"story-detection-and-plot-modeling","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 故事检测与情节建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/computational-narratology/story-detection-and-plot-modeling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"character-modeling-and-social-networks","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 人物建模与社会网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/computational-narratology/character-modeling-and-social-networks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sentiment-arcs-and-narrative-dynamics","title":"博士阶段 数字人文前沿 — 情感弧线与叙事动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/digital-humanities/computational-narratology/sentiment-arcs-and-narrative-dynamics"}]}]}